<view class="page-shell">
  <custom-nav title="&#x767B;&#x5F55;" />
  <view class="login-hero">
    <view class="hero-title">欢迎登录</view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">使用微信身份进入，只查看属于你的资料和线索。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="panel">
    <view class="title">微信登录</view>
    <view class="muted">真机测试会按微信 openid 隔离资料；分享出去的客户页除外。</view>
    <view class="field-label" style="margin-top: 24rpx;">昵称</view>
    <input class="field-input" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="handleNicknameChange" />
    <button class="primary-btn" bindtap="handleWechatLogin">微信登录</button>
    <button wx:if="{{allowMockLogin}}" class="secondary-btn" bindtap="handleMockLogin">本地 mock 登录</button>
  </view>
</view>
